00:48:23,900 --> 00:48:25,840
Hopefully this doesn't make a lot of noise or something.

872
00:48:26,340 --> 00:48:29,260
If that happens, we should immediately look for a place to hide.

873
00:48:29,820 --> 00:48:31,040
And if not...

874
00:48:31,040 --> 00:48:34,080
I run back to the save point...

875
00:48:34,080 --> 00:48:35,240
While throwing flares.

876
00:48:36,160 --> 00:48:37,280
That's the plan.

877
00:48:41,500 --> 00:48:42,120
Good.

878
00:48:42,340 --> 00:48:42,440
Good.

879
00:48:56,840 --> 00:48:57,740
The lights.

880
00:48:59,500 --> 00:49:00,300
Yes.

881
00:49:00,780 --> 00:49:01,260
Yes.

882
00:49:02,000 --> 00:49:02,460
Oh,

883
00:49:07,990 --> 00:49:08,410
man.

884
00:49:08,410 --> 00:49:09,010
We're here.

885
00:49:15,470 --> 00:49:15,770
Okay.

886
00:49:15,790 --> 00:49:16,530
There's nothing in there.

887
00:49:18,930 --> 00:49:20,930
There's nothing in these boxes ever.

888
00:49:23,760 --> 00:49:25,300
To, uh...

889
00:49:25,300 --> 00:49:25,620
To, uh...

890
00:49:25,620 --> 00:49:26,100
Sergeant Farber.

891
00:49:26,700 --> 00:49:27,560
Actually...

892
00:49:27,560 --> 00:49:28,440
SDT.

893
00:49:28,620 --> 00:49:29,020
I'm not sure.

894
00:49:30,920 --> 00:49:31,780
Senior...

895
00:49:34,530 --> 00:49:35,390
Maybe...

896
00:49:36,160 --> 00:49:36,590
Super...

897
00:49:37,470 --> 00:49:38,330
Devious...

898
00:49:38,330 --> 00:49:39,070
Trooper.

899
00:49:40,230 --> 00:49:41,250
Probably not.

900
00:49:41,310 --> 00:49:42,170
It's probably something French.

901
00:49:43,310 --> 00:49:45,930
I was there when they pulled your friend Neuer from the tunnels.

902
00:49:46,750 --> 00:49:49,270
He'd been screaming for hours before he was located.

903
00:49:49,890 --> 00:49:53,950
Tied to the stretcher, he was still trying to scream, but all that came out was a horrible rasp.

904
00:49:54,710 --> 00:49:56,730
All of the engineers have seen things down there.

905
00:49:57,130 --> 00:49:57,910
Myself included.

906
00:49:58,550 --> 00:50:01,570
We should talk, you and I, about what is to be done.

907
00:50:01,890 --> 00:50:02,790
Let me know when.

908
00:50:03,710 --> 00:50:04,130
Osan.

909
00:50:07,130 --> 00:50:08,090
Is that a safe?

910
00:50:09,510 --> 00:50:10,370
Oh, it's...

911
00:50:10,370 --> 00:50:11,050
Oh, shit.

912
00:50:11,050 --> 00:50:11,810
We gotta shoot that.

913
00:50:12,010 --> 00:50:13,070
Oh, and then hide in here.

914
00:50:15,030 --> 00:50:15,490
Yep.

915
00:50:15,810 --> 00:50:17,150
I see what's going on.

916
00:50:19,510 --> 00:50:21,930
I wonder if this is gonna make a lot of noise when I...

917
00:50:21,930 --> 00:50:22,950
do this.

918
00:50:25,650 --> 00:50:26,510
Farber is gone.

919
00:50:27,070 --> 00:50:27,530
Insanity.

920
00:50:27,690 --> 00:50:28,070
Chaos.

921
00:50:28,510 --> 00:50:31,850
We were in the mess and it burst from the shadows right behind Boss Rond.

922
00:50:32,330 --> 00:50:33,530
But Farber was there.

923
00:50:33,770 --> 00:50:34,210
Ready.

924
00:50:34,750 --> 00:50:36,410
Practically threw himself in front of the thing.

925
00:50:36,670 --> 00:50:37,630
And he shot it!

926
00:50:37,850 --> 00:50:38,750
Hit it, dead on!

927
00:50:39,130 --> 00:50:40,190
The thing retreated.

928
00:50:40,190 --> 00:50:41,870
We thought for sure it was dead.

929
00:50:42,450 --> 00:50:45,750
But then, not ten minutes later, it came back for him.

930
00:50:46,150 --> 00:50:50,030
I heard him screaming, being pulled into the wall, praying for salvation.

931
00:50:50,750 --> 00:50:52,330
And now I can hear it moving again.

932
00:50:52,570 --> 00:50:53,450
Getting closer.

933
00:50:54,150 --> 00:50:54,950
Have to move now.

934
00:50:55,430 --> 00:50:56,970
Or we'll all suffer his fate.

935
00:50:57,590 --> 00:50:59,430
Okay, so I can shoot it and it will retreat!

936
00:51:00,530 --> 00:51:02,710
Oh, that's actually great news!

937
00:51:04,330 --> 00:51:04,990
Loving that!

938
00:51:06,570 --> 00:51:07,970
Oh, and there's a hole right there!

939
00:51:09,550 --> 00:51:09,910
So...

940
00:51:10,750 --> 00:51:13,350
Do I open this first or do I contact here first?

941
00:51:15,330 --> 00:51:16,510
I'm gonna shoot this, I think.

942
00:51:17,470 --> 00:51:18,390
Shoot that and hide.

943
00:51:18,510 --> 00:51:18,750
You ready?

944
00:51:25,830 --> 00:51:27,730
Hide, hide, hide, hide, hide, hide, hide, hide, hide, hide, hide!

945
00:51:31,330 --> 00:51:32,930
I'm ready to shoot him if he opens this door.

946
00:51:33,990 --> 00:51:34,810
Oh, he's here!

947
00:51:35,850 --> 00:51:36,430
He's here!

948
00:51:39,840 --> 00:51:40,740
Oh, man!

949
00:51:42,180 --> 00:51:42,520
Oh!

950
00:51:43,680 --> 00:51:44,080
Oh!

951
00:51:47,580 --> 00:51:47,980
Wow!

952
00:51:50,360 --> 00:51:51,440
Yeah, don't open the door!

953
00:51:51,440 --> 00:51:53,340
I'm ready to shoot your ass if you do!

954
00:51:54,380 --> 00:51:55,980
Get the fuck out of here, Lambert!

955
00:51:56,820 --> 00:51:57,260
Leave!

956
00:51:59,840 --> 00:52:00,280
Oh!

957
00:52:21,560 --> 00:52:22,800
The lights are flickering.

958
00:52:25,880 --> 00:52:26,920
Is that when he's close?

959
00:52:29,540 --> 00:52:29,980
Lambert?

960
00:53:10,440 --> 00:53:12,000
Oh, he's bugging in the wall!

961
00:53:13,780 --> 00:53:14,660
Fuck you, bitch!

962
00:53:17,420 --> 00:53:18,260
Get out of here!

963
00:53:21,020 --> 00:53:22,220
Oh, it's so bugged!

964
00:53:26,160 --> 00:53:26,980
What's up, Lambert?

965
00:53:28,400 --> 00:53:29,160
What's going on?

966
00:53:29,700 --> 00:53:30,800
Let me just grab all this.

967
00:53:31,520 --> 00:53:32,180
You don't mind, do you?

968
00:53:33,620 --> 00:53:34,740
You don't mind if I grab that?

969
00:53:51,660 --> 00:53:52,060
Okay!

970
00:54:02,630 --> 00:54:03,030
Okay!

971
00:54:04,470 --> 00:54:05,530
See you later, Lambert!

972
00:54:11,670 --> 00:54:12,410
See you, nerd!

973
00:54:19,560 --> 00:54:20,420
Oh, my God!

974
00:54:22,760 --> 00:54:25,120
Well, I'm gonna go ahead and say that wasn't intended.

975
00:54:31,280 --> 00:54:32,060
Run, run, run!

976
00:54:36,530 --> 00:54:37,290
But you know what?

977
00:54:37,390 --> 00:54:38,390
I'm kinda happy that happened!

978
00:54:39,410 --> 00:54:39,550
Huh!

979
00:54:40,870 --> 00:54:41,530
Hoo-hoo!

980
00:54:41,870 --> 00:54:42,470
Hoo-hoo-hoo-hoo!

981
00:54:42,630 --> 00:54:44,410
Sometimes the game is on your side!

982
00:54:45,450 --> 00:54:46,330
Oh, man!

983
00:54:48,070 --> 00:54:49,430
Oh, Jesus Christ!

984
00:54:51,650 --> 00:54:52,730
Kind of a bummer, though.

985
00:54:53,450 --> 00:54:54,870
Broke the immersion a little bit there.

986
00:54:56,070 --> 00:54:57,330
Uh, let's fill this in.

987
00:55:01,940 --> 00:55:02,760
There we go!

988
00:55:03,420 --> 00:55:03,840
Wonderful!

989
00:55:08,400 --> 00:55:09,940
So wait a minute, what's the deal now?

990
00:55:10,520 --> 00:55:10,840
Arsenal.

991
00:55:11,660 --> 00:55:12,640
Because we got the code.

992
00:55:13,400 --> 00:55:14,540
Okay, let's cut it there.

993
00:55:15,200 --> 00:55:15,960
Thanks for watching.

994
00:55:16,420 --> 00:55:17,240
I'll see you in the next.

995
00:55:17,380 --> 00:55:17,680
Bye-bye!
